{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://task-workbench.local/contracts/light-1.0",
  "title": "轻量路线 A 阶段结构契约",
  "description": "日期 2026-11-10。设计冻结，B/D/E 实现及运行验收。旧 1.0.0 契约独立保留。",
